  CLASS_DECL
    LINE_COMMENT "// Every form a constraint takes. An implication, an `if` and a `foreach`"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// take constraints as their arms, and braces hold constraints only if there"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// is a `;` inside: `{a, b} == 2'b01` is a concatenation. A range may be a"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// value and its tolerance."
    WHITESPACE "\n"
